    "text": "Entry of the Download submenu in the context menu of an encrypted file, a folder of a private room or a private room. It saves the item as it is stored, still encrypted. Noun phrase without a verb: the parent menu item already says Download. Keep it parallel to the neighbouring entry Decrypted copy.",
    "is_auto": true,
    "updated_at": "2026-11-13T11:48:56.184Z",
